00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.680
The Nationals finally start tomorrow.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.520
So now we'll have our last ceremony.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.060
Huh?

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.850
A ceremony?

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:03.520
Here.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.810
Our self-reflection notebooks?

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:09.220
These notebooks contain everything.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:14.560
Since I've read through them
every day, I know it's true.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.060
So more than your training or practice...

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.770
...this is your most important ritual.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:24.430
Pass them around.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:25.680
Huh?

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.640
Uh, what do you mean?

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.180
You're going to read each other's notebooks.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:06.390
<i>I'll put an end to spending</i>
<i>my days so thoughtlessly</i>

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:10.430
<i>I'm dying to break free of this</i>

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:16.140
<i>Since I can never take that first step forward,</i>

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:20.220
<i>you always take my hand and pull me along</i>

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:26.100
<i>You've brought me to see</i>
<i>something completely new</i>

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.390
<i>My whole world is changing</i>

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.600
<i>With that first step</i>

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.770
<i>I felt transformed</i>

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:39.720
<i>I can go anywhere; it'll work</i>
<i>out so long as we're together</i>

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.310
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:42.930
<i>just as you are</i>

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.100
<i>At times you'll feel lost and scared,</i>

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:52.600
<i>but there are so many things you</i>
<i>won't know if you never give them a go</i>

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.220
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:59.100
<i>stretch out your hands until</i>
<i>you're almost touching the sky</i>

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:02.350
<i>We're not alone anymore</i>

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:07.470
<i>Together we'll fly into a new world</i>

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.550
Congrats on making it to Nationals!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.300
Congrats on making it to Nationals!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:18.710
Congrats on making it to Nationals!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:18.880
Congrats on making it to Nationals!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.220
Congrats on making it to Nationals!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:31.520
What's wrong? You won't win looking like that.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.270
But, I mean...

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.020
Yeah.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.060
What are you all blushing for?

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.430
Kin had such incredibly cute, round handwriting.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:47.470
Be a man and ignore that.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:52.770
S-S-Sho's notebook had so
many R-Risujiro stickers in it.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.060
N-Never mind that.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:59.270
Takeru, you wrote such passionate stuff.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.770
Please forget that!

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:04.350
All right, I forgot it!
So forget all of mine, too!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.810
And mine!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:14.390
And mine...

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.970
Guys, listen up!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:24.810
So... I never imagined this Men's Cheerleading Club
that started with just Haru and me

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:30.390
would attract this many members.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:36.720
Of course, we didn't have any
cheerleading experience, let alone a coach.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.220
Mizoguchi and Ton couldn't even do handstands.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.810
Thanks to Ichiro and Gen,
our group started to take shape.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:53.100
Then Sho joined us, and we managed
to start looking like cheerleaders.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:57.520
After the school festival ended,
our new, indispensable teammates

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.810
suddenly swelled our numbers to sixteen.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:10.600
And tomorrow's the National
Championship. Man, that's so cool!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:16.140
Really, I'm happy that we just got this far.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:23.220
Yeah, right! I'm still not satisfied!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:30.180
Tomorrow, let's put on our best...
<i>the </i>best performance yet!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.220
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.720
If we don't now, then when?

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.520
Right!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.810
We're gonna do it!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.640
We'll leave 'em speechless!

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.220
We do the best!

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:45.060
Good! I'll be rooting for you!

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:53.930
Somehow, with your hair still that color,
you don't look like yourself.

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:57.390
My appearance has changed, but I'm still me.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.680
You're right, but...

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:04.270
I dyed it gold only because I was showing off.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:08.720
I just thought that I was different.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:15.390
The coach saw right through me.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.390
<b>Be a real man!</b>

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.720
About your notebook...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.390
Don't mention my handwriting!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.560
No, it's not that...

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:24.930
I was very moved!

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:26.520
Me, too!

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:37.180
"A man becomes stronger only by being the bad guy."
There was a time in my life when I believed that.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:44.020
Though I'm sure in reality, I was simply just
another miserable, good-for-nothing man.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.180
But by doing cheerleading, I learned something.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.430
That a man becomes stronger only
when he does honest work every day,

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.720
and sees something through to completion.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:02.220
Bro, you wrote about nothing
but me in your notebook.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:11.850
The coach wrote "To spoil others is to spoil
yourself." Still, I couldn't help but worry.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:16.520
Your notebook had the same thing
as Gin's and Doh's written in it.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.330
<b>Be independent!</b>

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.330
<b>Be independent!</b>

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.330
<b>Be independent!</b>

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:25.350
But it was hilarious that all three of us
ended up writing about similar stuff.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:35.890
Big Bro will be leaving the team soon. I'll be sad,
but I think we can repay him by trying our hardest.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:40.930
I'm so grateful that he
invited me to join this team.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:44.520
My brother will be quitting before
long, too. While I'm sad about it,

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:51.100
I think I can pay him back by
doing my best. Thanks, Bro!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:56.720
I'm home, Arale!

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:06.060
You'll be house-sitting tomorrow, too. Sorry.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:13.020
Sho's notebook was honestly
nothing but Risujiro.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.270
And mine, Arale...

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:29.060
It had "Accept that people are
different from you!" written in it.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:33.930
But, y'know? Now I really get it.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:40.970
My reasons for wanting to do cheerleading
and everybody else's reasons all differ.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:44.310
Still, I've come to think that's a good thing.

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:51.220
You'll butt heads now and then, but sometimes
that's how you can solve your problems.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:54.680
That's exactly why team sports are so much fun.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:00.930
Perfect-o!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:15.310
I wonder if tomorrow will go well. It's the
Nationals. I might freak out or piss myself.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.310
A real man has
patience and guts!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.640
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:29.560
Don't wanna, don't wanna! I can't goof off
with my friends, and I've got no time.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.310
Apart from Ichiro, all these guys are snooze-fests.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:38.600
I just wanted to stand out, so why
do I have to put up with this crap?

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:45.560
What the hell are people falling down for?
I can't catch them like that. It freaks me out!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.350
That's right.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.770
Even now it freaks me out!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.310
Me, too.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:56.430
Why're you here?!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.100
I thought I should rehearse one more time.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.640
Don't surprise me like that!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.600
So you were scared, too.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.640
Huh?

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.930
I thought it was just me.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:14.060
But the flyers are probably
way more scared than me.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:21.140
So I have to make sure I catch them tight!
I'll catch every one of their souls!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.180
Well, "souls" was an exaggeration.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:34.270
No, I didn't know you were thinking
those things, so I was quite moved.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:39.930
Nah, seriously. I can't spin around
in the air n' stuff like that.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:43.810
I'm glad you were able to figure out
where you belonged, too.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.040
Embrace who you are!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:11:00.520
I've always hated myself. I've hated
how small I am, and how girly I look.

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.770
But...

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:07.970
Because I'm like this, I became a flyer.
Just like Kazu and Haru.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.720
